    "text": "This is a greedy heuristic, not an optimal solver. It repeatedly takes the vehicle that becomes free earliest and assigns it the feasible unassigned ride with the best gain per step, where gain is the ride's distance plus the bonus if it starts on time. A vehicle with no feasible ride left is dropped, which is safe because waiting or moving later only makes rides harder to reach. The main loop runs at most N + F times with an O(N) scan each, about 10^8 simple operations in the worst case. I have not compiled or run it against the data sets.\n\n```cpp\n#include <bits/stdc++.h>\nusing namespace std;\n\nint main() {\n    ios::sync_with_stdio(false);\n    cin.tie(nullptr);\n\n    int R, C, F, N;\n    long long B, T;\n    cin >> R >> C >> F >> N >> B >> T;\n\n    vector<int> a(N), b(N), x(N), y(N);\n    vector<long long> s(N), f(N);\n    for (int i = 0; i < N; ++i) {\n        cin >> a[i] >> b[i] >> x[i] >> y[i] >> s[i] >> f[i];\n    }\n\n    vector<char> used(N, 0);\n    vector<long long> px(F, 0), py(F, 0), tm(F, 0);\n    vector<vector<int>> res(F);\n\n    // Min-heap by (free time, vehicle id)\n    priority_queue<pair<long long, int>, vector<pair<long long, int>>,\n                   greater<pair<long long, int>>> pq;\n    for (int v = 0; v < F; ++v) pq.push({0LL, v});\n\n    while (!pq.empty()) {\n        auto [t, v] = pq.top();\n        pq.pop();\n\n        int best = -1;\n        long long bestGain = 0, bestDur = 1, bestFin = 0, bestStart = 0;\n\n        for (int i = 0; i < N; ++i) {\n            if (used[i]) continue;\n            long long d0 = llabs(px[v] - a[i]) + llabs(py[v] - b[i]);\n            long long st = max(t + d0, s[i]);\n            long long d1 = llabs((long long)a[i] - x[i]) + llabs((long long)b[i] - y[i]);\n            long long fin = st + d1;\n            if (fin > f[i]) continue;\n\n            long long gain = d1 + (st == s[i] ? B : 0LL);\n            long long dur = fin - t;\n            if (dur < 1) dur = 1;\n\n            bool better;\n            if (best < 0) {\n                better = true;\n            } else {\n                // compare gain/dur > bestGain/bestDur\n                long long lhs = gain * bestDur;\n                long long rhs = bestGain * dur;\n                if (lhs != rhs) better = lhs > rhs;\n                else better = fin < bestFin;\n            }\n            if (better) {\n                best = i;\n                bestGain = gain;\n                bestDur = dur;\n                bestFin = fin;\n                bestStart = st;\n            }\n        }\n\n        if (best < 0) continue; // vehicle finished, drop it\n\n        used[best] = 1;\n        res[v].push_back(best);\n        px[v] = x[best];\n        py[v] = y[best];\n        tm[v] = bestFin;\n        (void)bestStart;\n        pq.push({bestFin, v});\n    }\n\n    string out;\n    out.reserve(1 << 20);\n    for (int v = 0; v < F; ++v) {\n        out += to_string(res[v].size());\n        for (int r : res[v]) {\n            out += ' ';\n            out += to_string(r);\n        }\n        out += '\\n';\n    }\n    cout << out;\n    return 0;\n}\n```",
